## Workspace Context Detection

### Monorepo Structure Awareness
This project follows a monorepo structure with multiple workspaces:

#### Primary Workspaces
- **Root**: `/home/countzero/git/dnd_tools/`
- **Backend**: `/home/countzero/git/dnd_tools/apps/backend/`
- **Frontend**: `/home/countzero/git/dnd_tools/apps/frontend/`
